## User

Split a string on every occurrence of a separator character.

## Type

type
```haskell
splitOn :: Char -> String -> [String]
```

## Term

```haskell
splitOn c s = case dropWhile (== c) s of
  "" -> []
  s' -> w : splitOn c s''
    where (w, s'') = break (== c) s'
```

